✅ Final Summary
OLTP = transactional databases (fast, normalized, real-time).

OLAP = analytical warehouses (historical, aggregated, dimensional).

Fact tables = numbers (measures).

Dimension tables = context (descriptions).

ETL pipelines connect OLTP → OLAP, enabling analytics and decision-making.
